        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!  Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!  Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does a full release look like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Weapons: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons - to remain secret for now</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Bases: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different bases with different stats and graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Enemies: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special spawns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Difficulties:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties for both a harder time and an easier time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Modes: Extremely Optional</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, unlockable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes are optional to the scope of this project.  If they don't happen, just know they either weren't fun enough to release, or were not possible with this project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customization</strong></u><strong>:<u> Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a huge fan of customizing stuff in games so a possible goal is to allow customizing units/bosses/bases/backgrounds with your own assets or choosing colors.  Definitely depends on time/motivation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Achievements</strong></u></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!  Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!  Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does a full release look like?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Weapons: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 weapons - to remain secret for now</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Bases: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different bases with different stats and graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Enemies: </strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special spawns</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Difficulties:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different difficulties for both a harder time and an easier time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Modes: Extremely Optional</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different game modes, unlockable</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game modes are optional to the scope of this project.  If they don't happen, just know they either weren't fun enough to release, or were not possible with this project.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customization</strong></u><strong>:<u> Extremely Optional</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a huge fan of customizing stuff in games so a possible goal is to allow customizing units/bosses/bases/backgrounds with your own assets or choosing colors.  Definitely depends on time/motivation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Achievements</strong></u></p>",
        "short_description": "Doodle: Defense is an exciting roguelite tower defense game in which you play as a mining vessel defending yourself against the planets inhabitants!  Use ink to fire bullets and level up to upgrade yourself and add defenses!  Extraction will take 20 minutes, good luck!",
